# LF everywhere: shell scripts, SQL and configs are mounted into Linux containers as they are.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Compiled Protobuf descriptor set. It has no NUL byte, so Git would guess "text" and rewrite
# its 0x0a bytes on a CRLF checkout.
*.desc binary

# Rendered diagrams: keep the bytes D2 writes (no EOL conversion, so make diagrams-check compares
# exactly what CI renders) and collapse them in PR diffs; review the .d2 source instead.
*.svg -text
docs/diagrams/*.svg linguist-generated=true
